# Online layer smoke run (development, with --mcla_online=true --mcla_online_log=true and
# server/mcla-server.js running): boot into the city, open the pause menu and walk its tabs
# while logging the UI manager's movies, so that every call the game makes to the online
# layer during start-up and in the menus shows in the log; then quit. The tabs include the
# online one, which searches the server for lobbies and hosts one when it finds none (seen
# 2026-11-02: XSessionSearch twice, then XSessionCreate, XNetQosListen and XSessionJoin).
wait 8s
mark title
press_until start left_title every=2s timeout=90s
mark map_zoom
wait_until roam 180s
mark free_roam
wait 5s
log online-smoke: in the city; opening the pause menu
press start 4f
wait 1500ms 90f
screens
uisel
press rb 4f
wait 1000ms 60f
screens
uisel
press rb 4f
wait 1000ms 60f
screens
uisel
press rb 4f
wait 1000ms 60f
screens
uisel
press rb 4f
wait 1000ms 60f
screens
uisel
press rb 4f
wait 1000ms 60f
screens
uisel
press rb 4f
wait 1000ms 60f
screens
uisel
press rb 4f
wait 1000ms 60f
screens
uisel
log online-smoke: done
wait 2s
quit
